WEBVTT

00:00:17.870 --> 00:00:19.740
Hop, step, jump.

00:00:19.740 --> 00:00:21.640
Drew, draw, drawn.

00:00:21.640 --> 00:00:23.450
Chip, syrup, whip.

00:00:23.450 --> 00:00:24.900
Who I wanna be. 

00:00:32.140 --> 00:00:36.150
They call me calm, strong, and cool. 

00:00:36.150 --> 00:00:40.500
Everyone says I'm popular.

00:00:40.500 --> 00:00:43.910
But the truth is, I'm not like that at all. 

00:00:43.910 --> 00:00:47.120
I'm just an ordinary girl! 

00:00:47.120 --> 00:00:51.230
I wish I could just get rid 

00:00:51.230 --> 00:00:55.010
of all this pressure and be myself. 

00:00:55.010 --> 00:00:58.850
But they'd all say it's out of character. 

00:00:58.850 --> 00:01:03.260
Unlock my heart! 

00:01:04.070 --> 00:01:08.610
Just be who you wanna be. 

00:01:08.610 --> 00:01:11.460
Your Guardian Characters are with you. 

00:01:11.460 --> 00:01:15.710
Just do it the way you wanna do it. 

00:01:15.710 --> 00:01:18.780
It'll be okay, really! 

00:01:18.780 --> 00:01:23.690
Just be who you wanna be. 

00:01:23.690 --> 00:01:26.460
Having only one style would be way too boring. 

00:01:26.460 --> 00:01:30.720
Just do it the way you wanna do it. 

00:01:30.720 --> 00:01:34.990
You can do anything! 

00:01:35.860 --> 00:01:36.610
I know that...

00:01:36.610 --> 00:01:38.450
Hop, step, jump.

00:01:38.450 --> 00:01:40.340
Drew, draw, drawn.

00:01:40.340 --> 00:01:42.210
Chip, syrup, whip.

00:01:42.210 --> 00:01:43.520
...is who I wanna be. 

00:01:46.730 --> 00:01:51.350
In that case, Fujisaki-san will be in charge of drawing up the documents for the next meeting.

00:01:51.350 --> 00:01:52.960
Understood.

00:01:52.960 --> 00:01:55.880
Soma-kun, would you ask the sports department their thoughts?

00:01:55.880 --> 00:01:56.640
Okay.

00:01:57.010 --> 00:01:59.190
Yuiki-san, please assist them both.

00:01:59.190 --> 00:02:00.060
Okay!

00:02:00.570 --> 00:02:04.600
As for Hinamori-san, there's nothing for you.

00:02:04.600 --> 00:02:07.880
Why only me?

00:02:07.880 --> 00:02:10.520
We've told you before that the Joker is special, right?

00:02:10.520 --> 00:02:14.630
You don't have to do any of the annoying stuff. I envy you.

00:02:14.630 --> 00:02:18.100
Besides that, normal tasks don't seem like they'd suit you.

00:02:19.250 --> 00:02:20.380
Yeah.

00:02:20.380 --> 00:02:22.440
You think my character's like that?

00:02:23.040 --> 00:02:28.060
I've Fallen in Love with Your Eyes!

00:02:23.040 --> 00:02:28.060
Episode 8

00:02:28.060 --> 00:02:30.840
Amu-chan, you have to get it together.

00:02:30.840 --> 00:02:35.600
You're right, I somehow have to manage getting at least one job.

00:02:35.600 --> 00:02:38.870
Not that, I'm talking about Hotori-kun.

00:02:39.750 --> 00:02:42.090
You two haven't become any closer, have you?

00:02:42.090 --> 00:02:45.120
At this rate, there will have been no point in you joining the Guardians.

00:02:45.120 --> 00:02:47.890
Th-That's not actually why I joined.

00:02:48.270 --> 00:02:53.060
If there's anything I can do, just tell me. I wish the best for you.

00:02:54.320 --> 00:02:55.600
Nadeshiko.

00:02:56.020 --> 00:02:58.950
Anyway, I have a few things to do in the staff room.

00:02:59.570 --> 00:03:00.830
Good luck.

00:03:02.260 --> 00:03:06.630
Luck, huh? It'd help if I knew what I was trying to do.

00:03:09.680 --> 00:03:12.450
Hinamori Amu, I've found you!

00:03:12.450 --> 00:03:13.990
There!

00:03:15.590 --> 00:03:17.640
What was that?! Who are you?

00:03:18.940 --> 00:03:22.100
I'm Watarai Misaki, from the fifth-grade Moon Class.

00:03:22.100 --> 00:03:23.810
Nice to meet you, Hinamori Amu.

00:03:24.330 --> 00:03:25.430
Oh, likewise.

00:03:27.350 --> 00:03:27.810
An opening!

00:03:30.260 --> 00:03:31.160
Amu-chan.

00:03:31.160 --> 00:03:32.780
Even though she's the heroine.

00:03:32.780 --> 00:03:34.600
That pose is a bit...

00:03:34.600 --> 00:03:36.430
Okay, you pass!

00:03:36.560 --> 00:03:38.810
Here's a make-up handshake.

00:03:41.010 --> 00:03:42.570
Sorry, sorry.

00:03:42.570 --> 00:03:44.270
Anyway, listen up, Hinamori Amu.

00:03:45.180 --> 00:03:46.650
Why is she using her full name?

00:03:46.650 --> 00:03:48.930
I sense trouble.

00:03:49.580 --> 00:03:53.390
I like Tadase-kun.

00:03:53.850 --> 00:03:54.870
What? 

00:03:56.340 --> 00:03:58.170
A joint war effort?

00:03:58.170 --> 00:04:01.090
That's right, let's help each other out in this.

00:04:01.090 --> 00:04:03.430
Why even do something like that?

00:04:03.430 --> 00:04:06.800
Hinamori Amu, this is for your sake as well.

00:04:06.800 --> 00:04:08.860
Tadase-kun is the school's idol.

00:04:08.860 --> 00:04:13.510
In order to defeat all other rivals, it makes perfect sense to form a partnership!

00:04:13.510 --> 00:04:15.390
And I'm asking why you're picking me.

00:04:15.390 --> 00:04:20.390
Well, as a Guardian you're already close to Tadase-kun, and on top of that...

00:04:20.860 --> 00:04:21.720
On top of that?

00:04:21.720 --> 00:04:25.640
Since you were rejected in front of the entire student body, I know you're safe.

00:04:29.330 --> 00:04:31.270
The truth is, I like you, Prince!

00:04:32.160 --> 00:04:35.220
I already like someone. I'm sorry.

00:04:35.860 --> 00:04:38.120
I so wanted to forget that.

00:04:38.120 --> 00:04:39.680
Amu-chan, don't worry!

00:04:40.020 --> 00:04:44.520
But, Hinamori Amu, what you did was pretty cool. I was moved.

00:04:45.970 --> 00:04:46.810
Really?

00:04:46.810 --> 00:04:50.610
Hey, how much do you know about Tadase-kun?

00:04:51.330 --> 00:04:54.230
Now that I think about it, not all that much.

00:04:54.230 --> 00:04:59.310
Oh, really? Don't make that face. I'll tell you all about him.

00:05:00.520 --> 00:05:02.880
The King's Chair: Hotori Tadase.

00:05:02.880 --> 00:05:05.620
His birth date is March 29, and he's an Aries.

00:05:05.620 --> 00:05:07.310
His blood type is B. 

00:05:07.310 --> 00:05:10.520
An Aries and blood type B...

00:05:10.520 --> 00:05:13.390
By the way, what blood type do you have, Hinamori Amu?

00:05:13.710 --> 00:05:14.780
I'm an O.

00:05:14.780 --> 00:05:16.810
Your compatibility might not be that bad, after all.

00:05:16.810 --> 00:05:17.490
Really?

00:05:17.490 --> 00:05:19.670
Really, really. Are you happy?

00:05:19.670 --> 00:05:20.430
Yeah.

00:05:20.430 --> 00:05:22.270
All right, I look forward to working with you.

00:05:22.270 --> 00:05:23.550
Yeah.

00:05:23.550 --> 00:05:24.270
Huh?

00:05:24.270 --> 00:05:26.190
Amu-chan did it again.

00:05:26.190 --> 00:05:28.060
She got duped.

00:05:28.080 --> 00:05:30.580
Third Period
Arithmetic Test

00:05:31.040 --> 00:05:33.920
I totally got suckered again.

00:05:33.920 --> 00:05:36.360
Watarai Misaki is pretty hyper.

00:05:36.360 --> 00:05:39.390
Why are you laughing, Himamori-san?

00:05:39.390 --> 00:05:41.650
Sorry.

00:05:41.650 --> 00:05:44.540
Pay attention to your test, all right?

00:05:44.540 --> 00:05:45.520
Right.

00:05:45.520 --> 00:05:46.600
Good.

00:05:50.020 --> 00:05:52.870
You should pay attention too, Sensei.

00:05:52.870 --> 00:05:54.520
Don't space out, okay?

00:05:54.520 --> 00:05:56.720
Y-You're right.

00:05:58.040 --> 00:06:01.270
He's really not that dependable of a teacher.

00:06:03.790 --> 00:06:05.600
Lunch break!

00:06:05.600 --> 00:06:06.660
Let's play soccer.

00:06:06.660 --> 00:06:07.740
Yeah!

00:06:10.930 --> 00:06:13.210
W-What are you doing?

00:06:13.210 --> 00:06:16.090
In order to obtain victory on the battlefield, first know thine enemy.

00:06:16.090 --> 00:06:17.540
Look at that.

00:06:18.680 --> 00:06:20.420
A little more to the left.

00:06:21.340 --> 00:06:22.270
Right there!

00:06:22.270 --> 00:06:24.930
Oh, isn't that Yamabuki-san, from my class?

00:06:24.930 --> 00:06:31.780
Yamabuki Saya is the president of Seiyo Elementary's Hotori Tadase Fan Club! It has five members!

00:06:31.780 --> 00:06:33.180
We have one of those?

00:06:33.490 --> 00:06:36.650
Tadase-sama is an angel who has descended upon this school.

00:06:36.650 --> 00:06:39.730
We shall honor Tadase-sama as the Prince,

00:06:39.730 --> 00:06:43.070
and deal with him in a manner displaying appropriate calm and composure.

00:06:43.070 --> 00:06:44.680
Yes, Saya-sama!

00:06:45.090 --> 00:06:48.430
As always, please refrain from attempts to one-up any other members.

00:06:48.430 --> 00:06:50.500
She's kind of scary, though.

00:06:50.500 --> 00:06:55.060
She's truly an enemy to be feared. She and her organization will challenge us.

00:06:55.060 --> 00:06:57.310
But in the end, they're nothing more than a fan club.

00:06:57.310 --> 00:07:02.720
There's less than a 0.0000001% chance that an idol would hook up with a fan.

00:07:02.720 --> 00:07:05.390
Our true enemy lies elsewhere.

00:07:05.390 --> 00:07:07.100
Our true enemy?

00:07:07.100 --> 00:07:10.140
The enemy that we should consider the highest priority to defeat...

00:07:10.140 --> 00:07:11.310
Is...

00:07:11.310 --> 00:07:13.580
Fujisaki Nadeshiko!

00:07:14.310 --> 00:07:18.670
Using her position as Queen's Chair, she's already firmly placed herself at his side.

00:07:18.670 --> 00:07:21.890
She's an evil woman who is deceiving our beautiful Prince!

00:07:21.890 --> 00:07:24.310
U-Um, Nadeshiko really isn't like that.

00:07:24.310 --> 00:07:32.080
Shut up! The Misaki and Hinamori Amu Alliance shall crush Fujisaki Nadeshiko without delay!

00:07:32.630 --> 00:07:34.250
I-I told you no!

00:07:34.250 --> 00:07:38.220
Don't stop me, Hinamori Amu! This is to make both of us happy!

00:07:38.510 --> 00:07:40.260
Seriously, I'm telling you...

00:07:41.540 --> 00:07:42.810
Tadase-kun.

00:07:44.500 --> 00:07:45.470
Hinamori-san.

00:07:49.730 --> 00:07:51.640
You two are friends?

00:07:52.690 --> 00:07:54.810
Um, I...

00:07:55.660 --> 00:07:58.020
And she switches personalities on the fly.

00:07:58.380 --> 00:07:59.560
Is something wrong?

00:07:59.560 --> 00:08:02.220
No, nothing. Talk to you later!

00:08:05.280 --> 00:08:07.710
You totally fell apart when it really counted.

00:08:07.710 --> 00:08:12.740
Hinamori Amu, so did you! Even though you're a Guardian, you're no help at all!

00:08:12.740 --> 00:08:16.700
What about you? You're always so overly hyper, but you didn't do a darn thing!

00:08:31.490 --> 00:08:35.390
This is Saeki Nobuko's Guardian Spirit Divination for today!

00:08:35.390 --> 00:08:37.550
S-She's there!

00:08:37.550 --> 00:08:39.050
So boring.

00:08:39.050 --> 00:08:41.890
In short, you're worried about someone you like, right?

00:08:43.220 --> 00:08:44.920
How did you know?

00:08:44.920 --> 00:08:48.790
Who do you think I am? I'm Saeki Nobuko!

00:08:49.510 --> 00:08:53.540
I'll teach you a special love charm.

00:08:53.540 --> 00:08:57.810
What you'll need is a piece of paper with a star drawn on it in pink pen.

00:08:57.810 --> 00:09:01.770
First, you'll write the name of the boy you like on the paper.

00:09:02.050 --> 00:09:08.560
Once you do that, write your own name on the back so that it overlaps with his.

00:09:08.560 --> 00:09:11.390
Then his heart will belong only to you!

00:09:13.090 --> 00:09:15.850
Amu-chan, do you like a boy?

00:09:15.850 --> 00:09:16.240
Huh?

00:09:16.240 --> 00:09:17.390
What?!

00:09:17.390 --> 00:09:21.020
No way, boys are so childish and boring.

00:09:21.540 --> 00:09:24.820
That's right! Boys are boring!

00:09:24.820 --> 00:09:25.930
Dear.

00:09:30.690 --> 00:09:32.810
A love charm, huh?

00:09:33.090 --> 00:09:35.110
She's thinking about it! She's thinking about it!

00:09:35.110 --> 00:09:37.320
Even though she said she wasn't interested.

00:09:37.320 --> 00:09:39.300
A charm!

00:09:39.300 --> 00:09:42.850
A charm with Tadase-kun!

00:09:43.680 --> 00:09:47.510
Listen, you! Don't sing weird songs!

00:09:59.360 --> 00:10:02.180
The project is progressing smoothly.

00:10:02.870 --> 00:10:07.330
Your schedule will move along accordingly, Utau.

00:10:08.290 --> 00:10:09.560
I know.

00:10:09.890 --> 00:10:12.560
It won't be child's play from this point on.

00:10:24.390 --> 00:10:25.770
Ikuto.

00:10:32.000 --> 00:10:34.240
Aren't you late, Ikuto-kun?

00:10:35.030 --> 00:10:36.620
The Director is calling you.

00:10:39.220 --> 00:10:40.020
Ikuto!

00:10:42.590 --> 00:10:45.500
I'll grant your wish.

00:11:09.680 --> 00:11:12.470
Ta-da! It's our secret weapon: the love charm!

00:11:13.020 --> 00:11:15.200
You saw that show, too?

00:11:15.200 --> 00:11:19.350
Now all we have to do is write our names and Tadase-kun's heart will be ours!

00:11:21.970 --> 00:11:24.220
You're as hyper as usual.

00:11:24.580 --> 00:11:26.760
Anyway, let's go see Tadase-kun!

00:11:27.280 --> 00:11:29.210
We're going to ask him directly?

00:11:29.210 --> 00:11:31.040
And who else would you have do it?

00:11:31.040 --> 00:11:33.930
You ran away yesterday. Will you even be able to?

00:11:33.930 --> 00:11:39.640
I'll try harder today. After all, Tadase-kun approved of me.

00:11:47.770 --> 00:11:52.350
Sunset's a settin', set it 'n forget it.

00:11:53.760 --> 00:11:55.060
Oh, sorry.

00:11:56.530 --> 00:11:59.470
I'm always hyper. That's probably weird, right?

00:11:59.470 --> 00:12:01.850
I think it's good that you're always in high spirits.

00:12:11.090 --> 00:12:13.970
I was saved by those few words of his.

00:12:13.970 --> 00:12:16.290
I-I see.

00:12:16.290 --> 00:12:21.390
A lot of kids hate me because of how I am.

00:12:21.390 --> 00:12:25.350
But I can't help it. That's just my nature!

00:12:28.240 --> 00:12:29.720
What's wrong, Amu-chan?

00:12:30.080 --> 00:12:33.890
For a second, I thought she was pretty nice.

00:12:33.890 --> 00:12:36.770
Come on! Hurry up, Hinamori Amu!

00:12:36.770 --> 00:12:39.780
Could you stop calling me by my full name?

00:12:40.360 --> 00:12:45.140
Tadase's not here. He's pretty busy after school.

00:12:45.530 --> 00:12:47.460
He has a lot of meetings to go to,

00:12:47.460 --> 00:12:49.970
and a lot of clubs ask for his help.

00:12:48.730 --> 00:12:51.970
If Tadase-kun isn't here, we can leave.

00:12:52.000 --> 00:12:54.040
Yaya's lonely. 

00:12:53.170 --> 00:12:54.850
Thanks for the tea!

00:12:55.370 --> 00:12:56.850
Is Tadase-kun here?

00:12:57.140 --> 00:12:59.850
You're looking for Hotori-kun? He went to the library.

00:13:01.280 --> 00:13:02.660
Is Tadase-kun here?

00:13:03.290 --> 00:13:06.520
He was until just a second ago, but he went to the student council.

00:13:07.390 --> 00:13:09.060
Is Tadase-kun here?!

00:13:09.060 --> 00:13:12.220
I think he went to help the Tennis Club.

00:13:14.480 --> 00:13:16.230
Tadase-kun moves around too much!

00:13:16.230 --> 00:13:18.810
But I'm fired up! I'll definitely catch him!

00:13:20.310 --> 00:13:25.330
If Hinamori-senpai writes her name here, I might just die!

00:13:29.020 --> 00:13:31.640
If you're looking for Tadase-kun, he went back to the classroom.

00:13:31.640 --> 00:13:32.680
Rats!

00:13:32.680 --> 00:13:37.500
Saya-sama, two girls seem to have been taking strange actions lately.

00:13:37.500 --> 00:13:39.770
Oh, I wonder who they might be.

00:13:39.770 --> 00:13:42.720
Fifth-graders Watarai Misaki and Hinamori Amu.

00:13:43.100 --> 00:13:45.720
So it's <i>her</i> again.

00:13:45.720 --> 00:13:48.850
Saya-sama, just as we heard, here they are.

00:13:49.280 --> 00:13:52.510
This is a perfect opportunity! I'll tell her straight-

00:13:53.160 --> 00:13:55.060
She went by without stopping!

00:13:55.060 --> 00:14:00.430
I won't forgive her for ignoring me!

00:14:00.780 --> 00:14:02.270
Is Tadase-kun here?

00:14:03.560 --> 00:14:05.180
He is!

00:14:06.000 --> 00:14:07.810
Hinamori-san, what's wrong?

00:14:09.260 --> 00:14:12.220
Um, that's...

00:14:13.490 --> 00:14:15.800
Please write your name here.

00:14:16.650 --> 00:14:17.780
Please!

00:14:17.780 --> 00:14:18.930
Here's a pen.

00:14:21.770 --> 00:14:25.560
The Prince is so pretty.

00:14:26.770 --> 00:14:29.270
You just said "prince," didn't you?!

00:14:30.050 --> 00:14:30.850
This is bad!

00:14:31.130 --> 00:14:32.540
H-Hold on!

00:14:32.540 --> 00:14:35.140
Prince. Prince.

00:14:38.390 --> 00:14:41.390
Let's go, Tadase! We'll take over the world!

00:14:41.390 --> 00:14:44.490
Yes! We shall begin with the school!

00:14:45.610 --> 00:14:47.390
Calm down, Tadase-kun!

00:14:47.390 --> 00:14:48.470
Amu-chan!

00:14:49.180 --> 00:14:50.840
Looks like you're having a bit of trouble there.

00:14:50.840 --> 00:14:53.310
Nadeshiko-san, great timing!

00:14:55.930 --> 00:14:58.870
I wonder if Hinamori Amu will come back anytime soon.

00:14:58.870 --> 00:15:01.310
Oh, are you alone?

00:15:01.310 --> 00:15:03.310
Yamabuki Saya!

00:15:03.310 --> 00:15:07.490
You seem to be causing quite the stir around Tadase-sama.

00:15:07.490 --> 00:15:10.390
Don't you think it's about time you gave up?

00:15:10.390 --> 00:15:12.120
What do you mean by that?

00:15:12.120 --> 00:15:16.560
Tadase-sama doesn't like hyper girls like you.

00:15:16.560 --> 00:15:20.820
He's interested in graceful, mature girls like me.

00:15:20.820 --> 00:15:22.820
What does that matter?!

00:15:26.140 --> 00:15:28.720
What a spiteful girl.

00:15:28.720 --> 00:15:32.520
Saya-sama, it says nothing about him being "interested in graceful, mature girls"

00:15:32.520 --> 00:15:36.370
in the official Prince Fan Club Encyclopedia.

00:15:36.370 --> 00:15:38.010
That's because it was a lie.

00:15:38.010 --> 00:15:40.390
Should you be telling lies like that?

00:15:40.390 --> 00:15:46.100
In order to protect our Prince, any deed is perfectly warranted!

00:15:47.390 --> 00:15:54.350
Don't worry about Yamabuki Saya! Stay calm! Stay calm! Just sta-

00:15:54.350 --> 00:15:56.880
I caused you trouble again.

00:15:56.880 --> 00:15:57.770
Not at all.

00:15:57.770 --> 00:16:00.100
Tadase-kun is with Nadeshiko!

00:16:00.100 --> 00:16:04.810
It doesn't matter if that's who I want to be, I still feel depressed after Character Changing.

00:16:05.110 --> 00:16:08.140
It bothers me how I become so high-strung.

00:16:08.140 --> 00:16:10.760
It's not something you should worry about so much.

00:16:10.760 --> 00:16:11.660
See you later.

00:16:12.770 --> 00:16:15.850
Is what you just said true?

00:16:16.170 --> 00:16:18.640
That you dislike people who're high-strung?

00:16:19.840 --> 00:16:22.560
Do you hate energetic people?

00:16:22.560 --> 00:16:24.980
You were listening?

00:16:25.880 --> 00:16:28.020
That was kind of...

00:16:28.020 --> 00:16:30.940
I see.

00:16:36.430 --> 00:16:40.140
Tadase-kun doesn't like girls who are energetic.

00:16:40.140 --> 00:16:45.140
No matter how many love charms I try, a girl like me just won't cut it.

00:16:53.930 --> 00:16:57.520
I can see your heart's egg.

00:16:58.020 --> 00:17:01.060
Hey, Misaki!

00:17:01.060 --> 00:17:03.620
She's not here, is she?

00:17:03.620 --> 00:17:05.820
We keep getting dragged around everywhere.

00:17:05.820 --> 00:17:06.990
Seriously.

00:17:06.990 --> 00:17:08.620
Oh, over there!

00:17:09.430 --> 00:17:12.440
Jeez, don't just take off like that!

00:17:12.880 --> 00:17:14.860
The charm is worthless.

00:17:16.490 --> 00:17:18.360
I don't want to do it anymore.

00:17:19.220 --> 00:17:20.240
It's an X Egg!

00:17:20.240 --> 00:17:22.850
I don't want to be like this anymore!

00:17:24.130 --> 00:17:25.110
Love!

00:17:25.110 --> 00:17:28.430
Love! Hate!

00:17:32.270 --> 00:17:33.680
Misaki!

00:17:33.680 --> 00:17:38.290
What a pity. Not the Embryo, huh?

00:17:38.290 --> 00:17:43.060
Well, no big deal. Show me what your power can do, Himamori-san.

00:17:43.360 --> 00:17:47.060
Love? Hate? Love? Hate?

00:17:47.060 --> 00:17:48.310
Hate!

00:17:49.810 --> 00:17:51.640
No!

00:17:51.640 --> 00:17:54.230
Hate! Hate! Hate!

00:17:54.230 --> 00:17:57.200
Of course even her attacks are hyperactive!

00:18:00.430 --> 00:18:01.930
Holy Crown!

00:18:04.970 --> 00:18:06.620
Tadase-kun, why are you...

00:18:06.620 --> 00:18:08.600
I felt the presence of an X Character.

00:18:08.600 --> 00:18:11.560
Hinamori-san, now's your chance to Character Transform.

00:18:11.890 --> 00:18:12.990
Amu-chan!

00:18:16.140 --> 00:18:18.720
My heart: Unlock!

00:18:56.980 --> 00:18:59.420
Character Transformation: Amulet Heart!

00:19:02.890 --> 00:19:06.100
Thank you, Tadase-kun. I'll handle this.

00:19:09.700 --> 00:19:13.980
No one'll ever like someone as hyper as me!

00:19:13.980 --> 00:19:16.160
No one'll ever like me!

00:19:19.270 --> 00:19:24.060
After dragging me around all day, don't start doubting what makes you who you are!

00:19:25.760 --> 00:19:30.240
Why are you saying things that're so out of character? I happen to like you just as you are!

00:19:30.860 --> 00:19:32.810
Hinamori Amu?

00:19:34.730 --> 00:19:36.060
Negative Heart:

00:19:37.870 --> 00:19:38.920
Lock On!

00:19:44.320 --> 00:19:46.270
Open Heart!

00:20:00.750 --> 00:20:03.020
So this is your dream?

00:20:03.300 --> 00:20:06.820
I want to get married to the person I love and be happy.

00:20:06.820 --> 00:20:09.640
Have the best of loves in your future.

00:20:11.870 --> 00:20:12.680
Okay.

00:20:12.680 --> 00:20:16.060
Bye, Amu-chan. Thanks.

00:20:22.460 --> 00:20:25.610
Nice going, Himamori-san.

00:20:30.320 --> 00:20:33.000
Huh? Where am I?

00:20:33.600 --> 00:20:35.430
I think you're fine.

00:20:36.260 --> 00:20:39.850
There's nothing wrong with being hyper.

00:20:40.290 --> 00:20:42.070
Hinamori Amu.

00:20:42.070 --> 00:20:45.930
I think it's good for a girl to be full of energy, too.

00:20:48.120 --> 00:20:51.350
Did you hear that?! That means he likes me, right?!

00:20:51.350 --> 00:20:54.660
That's not even close to what he said. How exactly did you come up with that?

00:20:54.660 --> 00:20:57.600
I used my ears. Is that a problem?

00:20:57.600 --> 00:20:59.120
Dummy!

00:20:59.120 --> 00:21:01.220
I can't hear a word you're saying!

00:21:01.220 --> 00:21:03.350
Dummy! Dummy! Dummy!

00:21:06.350 --> 00:21:10.970
Hinamori Amu is my favorite! My favo-

00:21:12.480 --> 00:21:13.720
Oh, sorry.

00:21:15.190 --> 00:21:18.100
I'm always hyper. That's probably weird, right?

00:21:19.250 --> 00:21:20.970
I think it's good to be in high spirits.

00:21:31.040 --> 00:21:33.770
The next morning.

00:21:34.320 --> 00:21:37.400
I guess we never got to finish the love charm yesterday.

00:21:37.400 --> 00:21:39.390
Hinamori Amu!

00:21:39.390 --> 00:21:41.740
Oh, good morning. What are we going to do about yesterd-

00:21:41.740 --> 00:21:45.740
Listen! Listen! Kukai-senpai is really cool!

00:21:45.740 --> 00:21:47.060
Huh, Kukai?

00:21:47.060 --> 00:21:48.470
This isn't going to go...

00:21:48.470 --> 00:21:49.520
Like we think it will, right?

00:21:49.870 --> 00:21:55.580
But there's one problem: Yuiki Yaya. I'm positive she's after him!

00:21:57.090 --> 00:21:58.220
Knew it.

00:21:58.220 --> 00:22:00.720
Good morning, Amu-chi!

00:22:00.720 --> 00:22:03.360
Prepare yourself!

00:22:02.290 --> 00:22:03.360
What?!

00:22:03.360 --> 00:22:04.720
Yaya, run away!

00:22:05.200 --> 00:22:10.180
You did it, Saya-sama. It would appear the enemy has given up on Tadase-sama.

00:22:11.030 --> 00:22:15.510
How did she figure out that the person I truly like is Soma-sama?!

00:22:15.510 --> 00:22:17.650
S-Saya-sama.

00:22:16.510 --> 00:22:19.250
I'm so furious!

00:22:35.190 --> 00:22:41.290
As long as I exist, even when I'm a pile of dust, 

00:22:41.290 --> 00:22:47.690
I'll keep cheering "you can do it, you can do it" out loud! 

00:22:47.690 --> 00:22:48.510
(You can do it!)

00:22:48.510 --> 00:22:54.670
I'll never stop as long as I live,  

00:22:54.670 --> 00:23:01.020
so I'll sing my never-ending song. 

00:23:01.920 --> 00:23:05.530
I'll press forward down my path. 

00:23:05.530 --> 00:23:09.050
Even random characters have their merits. 

00:23:09.050 --> 00:23:13.890
You might be worthless, but I'll still love you, 

00:23:13.890 --> 00:23:15.360
my darling.

00:23:15.350 --> 00:23:19.150
You idiot! My true self... 

00:23:19.150 --> 00:23:22.110
Just say what's on your mind. 

00:23:22.110 --> 00:23:25.540
You're sticking out a little. 

00:23:25.540 --> 00:23:28.810
You're coming closer to my dream. 

00:23:28.810 --> 00:23:32.590
You jerk! My true self... 

00:23:32.590 --> 00:23:36.840
Please come out, don't hide. 

00:23:36.840 --> 00:23:41.780
Oh yeah! Right now! 

00:23:50.520 --> 00:23:52.790
Misaki-chan was such a hyper girl!

00:23:52.790 --> 00:23:54.770
The next story will be fast-paced, too!

00:23:54.770 --> 00:23:57.460
We're all going to sleep over at Nadeshiko's house.

00:23:57.460 --> 00:23:59.060
Really? We should hurry up and get ready!

00:23:59.060 --> 00:24:00.450
Do you have your pajamas?

00:24:00.450 --> 00:24:00.830
Check!

00:24:00.830 --> 00:24:01.820
Do you have your hair brush?

00:24:01.820 --> 00:24:02.520
Check!

00:24:02.520 --> 00:24:03.280
How about a present?

00:24:03.280 --> 00:24:03.870
Check!

00:24:03.870 --> 00:24:05.830
All right, I'm off!

00:24:05.830 --> 00:24:07.560
Have a safe trip!

00:24:07.560 --> 00:24:10.350
Wait, Amu-chan! What about us?!

00:24:10.350 --> 00:24:11.750
Next time on Shugo Chara:

00:24:11.750 --> 00:24:13.420
The Seven Mysteries of the Fujisaki Family!?

00:24:13.420 --> 00:24:15.090
Supposedly, at Nadeshiko's house

00:24:15.090 --> 00:24:16.870
there are lots of ghosts.

00:24:16.870 --> 00:24:19.220
What?! Really?
